VALUES (NULL, NULL, 222803, 'Age of Mythology: Retold', 'Age of Mythology: Retold', 'game', 2024, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8zm5.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2ryq.jpg', 'Age of Mythology: Retold is a remastered version of the 2002 real-time strategy classic Age of Mythology. Players manage civilizations inspired by Greek, Norse, and Egyptian mythologies, commanding human armies and legendary monsters while invoking the powers of gods to shape the battlefield. Built on the Age of Empires III: Definitive Edition engine, the remake features overhauled visuals, updated animations, and a symphonic reimagining of the original soundtrack. With modern design enhancements and expanded options, it offers a refreshed experience for both returning fans and new players.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/age-of-mythology-retold', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5"]', NULL, 8.4, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-28 13:59:23', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
