VALUES (NULL, NULL, 11674, 'The Journeyman Project 3: Legacy of Time', 'The Journeyman Project 3: Legacy of Time', 'game', 1998, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2k34.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/qdrpa4nzu8lnyadzyj7f.jpg', 'The Journeyman Project 3: Legacy of Time is a sequel to The Journeyman Project and The Journeyman Project 2: Buried in Time.
This final installment uses a 360° pre-rendered 3D CGI interaction system, similar to QuickTime VR. It featured impressive production values common for the series.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/the-journeyman-project-3-legacy-of-time', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 1.02, '2026-11-28 13:59:23', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
