VALUES (NULL, NULL, 263903, 'Arco', 'Arco', 'game', 2024, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8um5.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2hkt.jpg', 'Three tales forged in bloodshed, laced with magic, and united by revenge.

Enter the breathtakingly beautiful world of Arco, a unique tactical action game where your decisions shape the story. Journey through lush forests, sweeping plains, and scorching deserts as you guide four unlikely heroes in their vendetta against the Red Company gang.

Battle warriors of different nations, fend off greedy colonizers, and slay monstrous creatures as you voyage across this enchanted land. Change your fate, one move at a time.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/arco', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 7.0, 0, 1.02, '2026-11-28 13:59:23', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
