VALUES (NULL, NULL, 555, 'Transformers: War for Cybertron', 'Transformers: War for Cybertron', 'game', 2010, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9a64.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar39k1.jpg', 'Transformers: War for Cybertron is a third-person shooter video game based on the Transformers franchise. Set on the Transformers'' home planet of Cybertron, prior to their arrival on Earth, the game depicts the deadly civil war between Autobots and Decepticons. Players may pick either faction, as each has its own separate campaign.

The game was delisted at the end of 2017 and the online multiplayer servers were shutdown in April 2020.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/transformers-war-for-cybertron', '["PlayStation 3", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 7.2, 0, 10.04, '2026-11-28 13:59:23', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
