VALUES (NULL, NULL, 11133, 'Dark Souls III', 'Dark Souls III', 'game', 2016, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cob9ed.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/fhus0o2shprmwdzusa2s.jpg', 'Dark Souls III is an action role-playing game developed by FromSoftware and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment. Released in March 2016, it is the fourth entry in the Souls series and the final instalment in the Dark Souls trilogy. Set in the decaying kingdom of Lothric, players take on the role of the "Ashen One," an undead warrior tasked with rekindling the First Flame to prevent the world from falling into darkness.

The game features challenging combat, intricate level design, and a deep, lore-rich narrative.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dark-souls-iii', '["PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 8.7, 0, 12.06, '2026-11-28 13:59:23', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
