VALUES (NULL, NULL, 1141, 'Castlevania: Order of Ecclesia', 'Castlevania: Order of Ecclesia', 'game', 2008, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cob9km.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/yjaae5cwds1x2cdvvoyu.jpg', 'In the absence of the Holy Whip, those who live in fear of Dracula seek a replacement, which takes the form of the Order of Ecclesia, an organization that holds the secret to manipulating Glyphs. Shanoa, a young woman possessed with a unique ability to channel Glyphs, is chosen as our protector. This is her destiny and the story of the sacred Order of Ecclesia.

Use the brand new Glyph system with over 100 different attack combinations to battle Dracula and his minions throughout 20 explorable areas! Take part in side quests and collect items to power up! Experience a gripping storyline featuring new characters!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/castlevania-order-of-ecclesia', '["Nintendo DS"]', NULL, 8.5, 0, 9.01, '2026-11-28 13:59:23', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
