VALUES (NULL, NULL, 54538, 'Magic: The Gathering Arena', 'Magic: The Gathering Arena', 'game', 2019, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1l8n.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar5ib.jpg', 'Magic: The Gathering - Arena is a free to play digital, collectible card game by Wizards of the Coast that places the players in the shoes of a powerful magic-user that can cast spells, summon creatures, and attack opposing players.

Arena adds entire sets from the physical card game and features several modes/formats to play, including constructed, limited, and draft formats all of which also have their own season long rankings.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/magic-the-gathering-arena', '["Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "Mac"]', NULL, 7.8, 0, 7.01, '2026-11-28 13:59:23', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
