The player incarnates a private investigator in 1920s, who finds himself in a city of New England, Oakmont Massachusetts. It''s currently suffering from extensive waterflood, and its cause is clearly supernatural.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/the-sinking-city', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 7.0, 0, 1.02, '2026-11-28 13:59:23', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
