VALUES (NULL, NULL, 547, 'Gears of War', 'Gears of War', 'game', 2006, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8rkr.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/jrkvtsb1kewckzozmuwm.jpg', 'Gears of War is a third-person shooter built around a cover system, where players duck behind obstacles and use tactical fire to advance on enemies. The signature weapon is an assault rifle fitted with a chainsaw bayonet, and a timed reload mechanic can grant a brief damage bonus or jam the gun if mistimed. The five-act campaign can be played solo or in two-player co-op, and a competitive multiplayer mode supports up to eight players split between the two factions. It was the first game in the Gears of War series and helped popularize the modern cover-based shooter, later receiving remastered versions.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/gears-of-war', '["Xbox 360"]', NULL, 8.3, 0, 8.695, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
