VALUES (NULL, NULL, 233571, 'Hitman World of Assassination', 'Hitman World of Assassination', 'game', 2023, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co620f.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar307p.jpg', 'Become Agent 47 in the ultimate spy-thriller adventure across more than 20 locations.

Hitman World of Assassination brings together the best of Hitman, Hitman 2 and Hitman 3 including the main campaign, contracts mode, escalations, elusive target arcades and Hitman: Freelancer.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/hitman-world-of-assassination', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "Nintendo Switch 2", "PlayStation VR", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "SteamVR", "PlayStation 5", "Mac", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 9.0, 0, 8.165, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
