VALUES (NULL, NULL, 288, 'Operation Flashpoint: Cold War Crisis', 'Operation Flashpoint: Cold War Crisis', 'game', 2001, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/coca14.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/enmbmhwf5dsbjjhcp6cz.jpg', 'Bohemia Interactive''s debut game published by Codemasters as Operation Flashpoint in 2001, became genre-defining combat military simulation and the No. 1 bestselling PC game around the world and has won many international awards, including “Game of The Year” and “Best Action Game”. Over 2 million copies have been sold since its release.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/operation-flashpoint-cold-war-crisis', '["Xbox", "PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 8.9, 0, 1.07233333333333344e+01, '2026-11-26 02:21:07', '2026-11-28 13:59:23')
